{"id":"54207c2b1fc6db5d","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-primitive-recursion-closure.md","title":"Primitive Recursion Closure","display":"df-primitive-recursion-closure — Primitive Recursion Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-primitive-recursion-closure","aliases":["68-df-primitive-recursion-closure"],"display":"df-primitive-recursion-closure — Primitive Recursion Closure","depends_on":["[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§5 induction and Proposition 5.3, pp.9-10 / PDF 18-19","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-primitive-recursion-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-primitive-recursion-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursion-closure — Primitive Recursion Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5 induction and Proposition 5.3, pp.9-10 / PDF 18-19"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_n,\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F_n,\\mathcal F\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathcal F\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N^{n+2}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N^{n+2}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 均为全函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PR}(g,h):\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{PR}(g,h):\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 由下列自然数递归方程引入，输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x\">\\(\\langle y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x\\)</span>；连接算子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}\\)</span> 为以下引入的闭包。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)(\\langle0\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x)=g(\\vec x),\\qquad\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)(\\langle y+1\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x)=h\\bigl(\\langle\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)(\\langle y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x),y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)(\\langle0\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x)=g(\\vec x),\\qquad\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)(\\langle y+1\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x)=h\\bigl(\\langle\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)(\\langle y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x),y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}(F):=\\bigcap\\{G\\subseteq\\mathcal F:F\\subseteq G\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in G\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^n}\\;\\forall h\\in G\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{n+2}}\\;(\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)\\in G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}(F):=\\bigcap\\{G\\subseteq\\mathcal F:F\\subseteq G\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in G\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^n}\\;\\forall h\\in G\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{n+2}}\\;(\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)\\in G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §5.3，印刷 pp.9–10 / PDF pp.18–19。按原书的 inductively closed 只对全的 g,h 使用该递归构造，而非未经声明的偏递归模式。自然数递归定理保证 PR 的存在、唯一性与全性；交集的被交族包含 \\mathcal F。函数参数顺序与原书一致。来源替代了先前未逐签名核对的第 88 本导入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_n,\\mathcal F$ 见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$F\\subseteq\\mathcal F$。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$g:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N$、$h:\\mathbb N^{n+2}\\to\\mathbb N$ 均为全函数。$\\operatorname{PR}(g,h):\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N$ 由下列自然数递归方程引入，输入为 $\\langle y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x$；连接算子见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_n,\\mathcal F$ 见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$F\\subseteq\\mathcal F$。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$g:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N$、$h:\\mathbb N^{n+2}\\to\\mathbb N$ 均为全函数。$\\operatorname{PR}(g,h):\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N$ 由下列自然数递归方程引入，输入为 $\\langle y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x$；连接算子见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_n,\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N^{n+2}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PR}(g,h):\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)(\\langle0\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x)=g(\\vec x),\\qquad\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)(\\langle y+1\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x)=h\\bigl(\\langle\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)(\\langle y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x),y\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}(F):=\\bigcap\\{G\\subseteq\\mathcal F:F\\subseteq G\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in G\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^n}\\;\\forall h\\in G\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{n+2}}\\;(\\operatorname{PR}(g,h)\\in G)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2000,"backlinks":[{"id":"5f5b8b347f696f58","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-primitive-recursion-closure]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-primitive-recursion-closure]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-primitive-recursion-closure|df-primitive-recursion-closure — Primitive Recursion Closure]]"}],"outgoing":["c524671590651be2"]}